# MEDBOURSE Core

Before code changes: read `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT_STATE.md`, and relevant `TASKS.md` entries.

- Greenfield or existing: **audit the repo**; do not rebuild working features.
- Backend must enforce RBAC; customer/staff/admin/super_admin.
- Money: exact decimals + currency code; quotation snapshots immutable.
- Sensitive documents: private storage, signed URLs, server authorization.
- i18n: en, tr, fr, ar with real RTL (logical CSS).
- Update `PROJECT_STATE.md` at meaningful checkpoints.
- Never mark tests passed without running them.

Canonical rules live in `AGENTS.md`; do not duplicate conflicting instructions elsewhere.
